9c588) 和 `container.waiting_message` (fact-1488920e56a0) 均一致报错 `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`。\n*   **状态印证**：`container.waiting_reason` (fact-80b0b483ac22) 为 `CreateContainerConfigError`，且 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-189ba8824469) 指标确认了该状态。\n*   **结论**：配置层面的 Secret 键名不匹配直接导致了容器配置的加载失败，这是造成 Pod 无法启动的唯一确定性原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 78.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 78.3s (Evidence 69.5s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 105.737, "metrics": {"run_id": "2efd3c19abb8489f", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 105.7427225112915, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight":